{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/d0jax03i","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":88,"top":191.67,"width":1104,"height":456.83},"name":"Content Placeholder 2","text":"The Need for Balance: People spend a lot of time online, making it important to balance daily internet use with good sleep and mental health.\nWhat is SignalWell AI?: It is a web app that tracks browser usage and lets users record their sleep, mood, and daily stress levels.\nTwo Distinct Modes: The app has a live version for real users and a separate testing mode that uses fake (synthetic) data for safe research.","style":{"fontSize":37.33,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
