{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/jyx0ra1s","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"Title and Content"},"title":"Problem Statement","textShapes":4,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1cj2d8b6","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":88,"top":38.33,"width":1104,"height":139.17},"name":"Title 1","placeholder":"title","text":"Problem Statement","style":{"fontSize":58.67,"typeface":"Calibri Light","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0ba143al","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":88,"top":191.67,"width":1104,"height":456.83},"name":"Content Placeholder 2","text":"Main Problem Statement: Most screen time apps only tell the user how many minutes they spent on a device. They do not track how that screen time affects their mood or sleep.\nOur Proposed Solution: SignalWell AI allows users to track both digital habits and physical well-being in one place. It also includes a safe, private sandbox mode to test smart data models without risking real user data.","style":{"fontSize":37.33,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
