{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5svutgni","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":47.14,"top":84,"width":1186.29,"height":420.51},"name":"TextBox 13","text":"\nMain Goal: Build SignalWell to help users track changes in their digital habits and well-being.\nCore Tasks:\nHabit Tracking: Log screen time and website usage safely via a browser tool.\nPersonal Baseline: Compare metrics against a user's own 7-day average.\nData Privacy: Lock down data using database Row Level Security (RLS).","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
