{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sjix0zy1","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":58.84,"top":170.57,"width":1163.45,"height":507.31},"name":"Rectangle 6","text":"\nData Integration: Tracks screen time, website use, sleep duration, mood, stress, and anxiety.\nPersonalized Baseline: Measures daily shifts against the user's past 7-day average using the equation:\n\\(\\Delta X_t = X_t - \\mu_{t-1:t-7}\\).\nDatabase Isolation: Applies Row Level Security directly to block cross-account data leaks (auth.uid() = user_id).\nRuntime Verification: Implements server middleware to block inference requests if the model registry path is missing.\n","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":37.33,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fu1gfa1s","slideIndex":7,"text":""}
