{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bih4na5w","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":88,"top":153.12,"width":1137.71,"height":552.54},"name":"Rectangle 7","text":"Frontend Web App: Next.js 14, React 18, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.\nData Visualization: Recharts library for continuous behavioral trend graphs.\nDatabase & Security: Supabase platform using a PostgreSQL engine with Row Level Security.\nBrowser Automation: Native JavaScript Service Workers built on Chrome Manifest V3.\nBackend Processing: Python FastAPI framework run via a Uvicorn local server.\nMachine Learning Tools: Pandas data processing, Scikit-learn models, and XGBoost structures.\n","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":37.33,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/udsvah03","slideIndex":8,"text":""}
