{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/725onyl4","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80.57,"top":151.72,"width":1182.86,"height":462.07},"name":"Rectangle 7","text":"Core Monitored Attributes: Tracks Sleep Duration, Screen Time, Movement Level, Subjective Mood, Stress Response, and Anxiety Self-Assessment.\nDataset Characteristics: Evaluated using a simulated research dataset containing 2,500 daily tracking records distributed across 120 user accounts.\nEnvironment Setup: Local deployment executing paths out of target user directory folders (C:\\Users\\ASUS\\Documents\\signalwell-ai-2) on local ports 3000 and 8000.\nValidation Tools: Codebase rules checked using TypeScript compilers, Zod schemas, Pydantic data layers, and the pytest testing library.\n","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":37.33,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"justify"}}
