{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/k3y5ov21","slideIndex":14,"position":{"left":88,"top":191.67,"width":1104,"height":456.83},"name":"Content Placeholder 2","text":"Safe Architecture: Decoupling the live database from a 30-day synthetic dataset enables secure ML testing without risking account contamination.\nVerified Stability: The dual-path setup successfully verified 18 automated backend test cases under full model serialization loops.\nGuaranteed Privacy: The system proves that health tracking over browser logs must be sandboxed by strict Row Level Security to stop cross-account leaks.","style":{"fontSize":37.33,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
